    sizes=&quot;(max-width: 640px) 100vw, (max-width: 1200px) 80vw, 900px&quot;
    alt=&quot;Oil painting featuring a large spiral of tightly layered concentric rings in golden yellow and sky blue dominating the left side of the canvas, set against a textured yellow-green field with blue speckled marks and a curving pink arc along the right edge.&quot;
