    sizes=&quot;(max-width: 640px) 100vw, (max-width: 1200px) 80vw, 900px&quot;
    alt=&quot;Oil painting of a glowing orange-speckled figure riding atop a dark silhouetted bison against a dramatic deep blue twilight sky, with a thin orange horizon line below.&quot;
